  levelId: level_29
  levelTitle: Power Budget - Dual-Brightness LED
  initialPage: 0
  pages:
  - title: LEVEL 29 | Workbench Wiring / ECO
    explanation: 'Keep the fixed Battery_positive -> SwitchInput wire. Add six wires:
      SwitchOutput -> SPDT_COM; SPDT_A -> R_BRIGHT_Input; R_BRIGHT_Output -> LED_Anode;
      SPDT_B -> R_ECO_Input; R_ECO_Output -> LED_Anode; LED_Cathode -> Battery_negative.
      Remove old capacitor/diode wiring. Two resistor outputs join at LED anode.
      Never join SPDT A and B. Colours identify branches, not live voltage.'
    caption: 'PAGE 1/4 | S04: 330 OHM | S05: 1k OHM | S06: SPDT | MAIN ON'
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.08, y: 0.73}
      label: BATTERY +5V
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.3, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    - id: negative
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.08, y: 0.18}
      label: BATTERY -
      color: {r: 0.2, g: 0.68, b: 1, a: 1}
    - id: main_in
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.22, y: 0.73}
      label: MAIN IN
      color: {r: 0.2, g: 0.9, b: 0.95, a: 1}
    - id: main_out
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.33, y: 0.73}
      label: MAIN OUT
      color: {r: 0.2, g: 0.9, b: 0.95, a: 1}
    - id: a
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.51, y: 0.67}
      label: A / BRIGHT
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.72, b: 0.25, a: 1}
    - id: b
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.65, y: 0.67}
      label: B / ECO
      color: {r: 0.3, g: 0.95, b: 0.58, a: 1}
    - id: com
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.58, y: 0.48}
      label: S06 COM
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.3, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    - id: bright_in
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.76, y: 0.57}
      label: S04 330 OHM
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.72, b: 0.25, a: 1}
