  - title: LEVEL 29 | Test BRIGHT
    explanation: 'MAIN ON, select A. Current flows through the 330 Ohm resistor in
      Slot_04 and LED. For a 2 V LED: (5-2)/330 = 9.09 mA; source power approximately
      45.5 mW. Slot_05 carries approximately zero current. BRIGHT is a learning step,
      not the completion state.'
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | COM-A CLOSED | COM-B OPEN | EXPECT ABOUT 9 mA
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
