    explanation: 'Keep MAIN ON and select B. Current flows through the 1k Ohm resistor
      in Slot_05 and LED. For a 2 V LED: (5-2)/1000 = 3 mA; source power approximately
      15 mW, about 67 percent less. Slot_04 carries approximately zero current. The
      LED remains on with lower brightness. No capacitor is used.'
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | COM-B CLOSED | COM-A OPEN | EXPECT ABOUT 3 mA
