  - title: LEVEL 29 | Six Completion Targets
    explanation: 'All six targets must pass: source 4.8-5.2 V; LED ON; ECO resistor
      current 2.5-3.5 mA; BRIGHT resistor current at most 0.05 mA; ECO resistor voltage
      2.7-3.3 V; source current 2.5-3.5 mA. A valid source return and healthy installed
      resistors are required. Static targets validate the final state, not a BRIGHT-then-ECO
      sequence or exact wiring topology. Drawings do not award completion.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | FINAL ECO STATE | HEALTHY PARTS | CLOSED RETURN | NO SHORTS
